sequenceDiagram
    participant Prev as x[k-1], P[k-1]
    participant Control as u[k] = speed + heading
    participant Model as Local motion model
    participant Sigma as Sigma points
    participant GPS as GPS measurement
    participant UKF as Unscented update
    participant Next as x[k], P[k]

    Prev->>Model: initialize state
    Control->>Model: apply motion control
    Prev->>Sigma: generate spread
    Sigma->>Model: propagate candidates
    Model->>UKF: predicted mean and covariance
    GPS->>UKF: position correction if usable
    UKF->>Next: corrected state estimate
    Next->>Next: log DR track / FIT output
